<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money market shortage up to 7.190 bln rand. [CORRECTED 08:13 GMT]</title>
<headline>SAfrica money market shortage up to 7.190 bln rand. [CORRECTED 08:13 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects amount in title from 6.472 bln rand)</p>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage rose to 7.190 billion rand (corrects from 6.472 bln rand) on Monday from 6.427 billion rand on Saturday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
